    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d940">

                <pb facs="0899" n="585" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg585"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111G27/3</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Japanese Ambassador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chinda</hi>)</head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-30">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">October 30, 1914</hi>.</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My dear Mr. Ambassador</hi>: In reply to your note
                    of the 28th instant in regard to the German gunboat <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Geier</hi>, now undergoing repairs at Honolulu, I would advise you that the
                    Imperial German Ambassador in this capital has been informed of this
                    Government’s intention to fix a definite period within which repairs to this
                    vessel should be completed, and that if it is found impossible to complete the
                    repairs within the period set, the United States will be obliged to insist that
                    the gunboat be interned during the present war. Instructions have been issued to
                    the United States officers to inform the captain of the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Geier</hi> in this same sense.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
